      "Set (HashSet): uniqueness enforced — adding lab-web twice stores it once; contains is fast at any scale. The set answers membership and dedup questions. Map (HashMap): key→value pairs — counts per host, config by name — with get, containsKey, and merge(key, 1, Integer::sum) as the counting idiom, Java's version of Python's counts.get(k, 0) + 1.",
